FURB142 [*] Use of `set.add()` in a for loop
 --> FURB142.py:7:5
  |
6 |   def _():
7 | /     for x in [1, 2, 3]:
8 | |         s.add(x)
  | |________________^
help: Replace with `.update()`
  |
6 | def _():
  -     for x in [1, 2, 3]:
  -         s.add(x)
7 +     s.update([1, 2, 3])
